5. Kontrollkommandon
show spanning-tree
show spanning-tree vlan 10
show interfaces trunk

Root = Root Port
Desg = Designated Port
Altn = Alternate Port
FWD = Forwarding
BLK = Blocking

6. STP failover-test – SW-Nordvik-2
enable
configure terminal
interface gi0/1
shutdown
end

show spanning-tree

När Gi0/1 var nere tog Fa0/24 över som Root Port:
SW-Nordvik-2 -> SW-Nordvik-3 -> SW-Nordvik-1

Återställ länken:
configure terminal
interface gi0/1
no shutdown
end

show spanning-tree vlan 10

7. SW-Nordvik-1 – Root Primary
enable
configure terminal
spanning-tree vlan 10,20,30,99 root primary
end

show spanning-tree vlan 10

8. SW-Nordvik-2 – Root Secondary
enable
configure terminal
spanning-tree vlan 10,20,30,99 root secondary
end

show spanning-tree vlan 10

Slutresultat:
SW-Nordvik-1 = Root Primary
SW-Nordvik-2 = Root Secondary
SW-Nordvik-3 = vanlig STP-switch
